ighlight\">происходит взрыв</span>, наносящий <Panel class=\"AbilityPropertyIcon prop_tech_damage\"> <span class=\"highlight_spirit\">урон</span> всем врагам поблизости. <br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Каждый трамплин позволяет прыгающему произвести взрыв при приземлении только раз.</span>","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"3190606822","name":"Spirit Lasso","nameRu":"Спиритическое лассо","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/astro/holliday_spirit_lasso.png","className":"ability_gravity_lasso","description":"Throw out your lasso, dealing <svg width=\"128\" height=\"128\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" fill=\"white\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M53.7875 20.0238C48.6533 13.3022 40.8042 9 32.0027 9C16.5345 9 4 22.2789 4 38.6558C4 38.7707 4.00052 38.8854 4.00155 39H91.8416L94.7229 33.1618C97.2906 27.9591 104.71 27.9591 107.277 33.1618L110.159 39H115.998C115.999 38.8854 116 38.7707 116 38.6558C116 22.2789 103.466 9 87.9973 9C79.1958 9 71.3467 13.3022 66.2125 20.0238C65.7565 20.6214 65.336 21.1783 64.9462 21.6946C62.4734 24.9699 61.2367 26.6078 59.9993 26.6084C58.7614 26.609 57.5227 24.9711 55.0449 21.6946C54.6545 21.1783 54.2333 20.6214 53.7766 20.0238H53.7875Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n<path d=\"M79.7015 79L79.5588 79.8323C78.7516 84.5386 82.6742 88.3253 86.9508 88.0132C86.8571 88.1111 86.7634 88.209 86.6696 88.3069C78.1991 97.1552 69.4174 106.328 62.6218 116.742C61.1111 119.051 58.8889 119.051 57.3782 116.742C50.5788 106.325 41.7966 97.1509 33.3264 88.303C30.3317 85.1748 27.3761 82.0873 24.5608 79H79.7015Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n<path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M101.901 35.5496C101.512 34.8168 100.488 34.8168 100.099 35.5497L93.0406 48.845C92.8929 49.123 92.6315 49.3183 92.3283 49.3766L77.8385 52.1641C77.0398 52.3178 76.7233 53.3185 77.2815 53.9252L87.4091 64.9295C87.6209 65.1597 87.7208 65.4756 87.6812 65.7898L85.7842 80.8078C85.6796 81.6357 86.5083 82.2542 87.2424 81.8963L100.56 75.402C100.838 75.266